unning harbor city famous for its iconic Opera House and the golden sands of Bondi Beach.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506973035872-a4ec16b8e8d9?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixid=M3wxMDUwMjE5fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8MXx8U3lkbmV5JTIwY2l0eSUyMGxhbmRzY2FwZXxlbnwwfDB8fHwxNzg5OTMzMzg5fDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=80&w=1080','2026-08-31 13:47:25','SYD'),(21,'Rio de Janeiro','mare','A spectacular coastal metropolis known for Copacabana, samba, and the Christ the Redeemer statue.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1483729558449-99ef09a8c325?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixid=M3wxMDUwMjE5fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8MXx8UmlvJTIwZGUlMjBKYW5laXJvJTIwY2l0eSUyMGxhbmRzY2FwZXxlbnwwfDB8fHwxNzg5OTMzMzkyfDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=80&w=1080','2026-08-31 13:47:28','GIG'),(22,'Antalya','mare','A Turkish resort city featuring a yacht-filled Old Harbor and beaches flanked by large hotels.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1703595934475-5913f0328c22?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixid=M3wxMDUwMjE5fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8MXx8QW50YWx5YSUyMGNpdHklMjBsYW5kc2NhcGV8ZW58MHwwfHx8MTc4OTkzMzM5NHww&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=80&w=1080','2026-08-31 13:47:30','AYT'),(23,'Palma de Mallorca','mare','A beautiful Mediterranean island capital boasting a massive Gothic cathedral and pristine coves.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1704530432296-7ef9af31f769?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixid=M3wxMDUwMjE5fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8MXx8UGFsbWElMjBkZSUyME1hbGxvcmNhJTIwY2l0eSUyMGxhbmRzY2FwZXxlbnwwfDB8fHwxNzg5OTMzMzk3fDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=80&w=1080','2026-08-31 13:47:32','PMI'),(24,'Innsbruck','montagna','The capital of the Alps, offering world-renowned winter sports and imperial architecture.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1707133105893-1216d1cc4c53?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixid=M3wxMDUwMjE5fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8MXx8SW5uc2JydWNrJTIwY2l0eSUyMGxhbmRzY2FwZXxlbnwwfDB8fHwxNzg5OTMzNDAwfDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=80&w=1080','2026-08-31 13:47:34','INN'),(25,'Zermatt','montagna','An idyllic, car-free Swiss village nestled right below the iconic, pyramid-shaped Matterhorn peak.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507039102241-5ec61d624406?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixid=M3wxMDUwMjE5fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8MXx8WmVybWF0dCUyMGNpdHklMjBsYW5kc2NhcGV8ZW58MHwwfHx8MTc4OTkzMzQwM3ww&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=80&w=1080','2026-08-31 13:47:37','ZRH'),(26,'Chamonix','montagna','The birthplace of extreme skiing, located at the base of Mont Blanc, the highest summit in the Alps.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1631886668633-b313de0ebe8d?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixid=M3wxMDUwMjE5fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8MXx8Q2hhbW9uaXglMjBjaXR5JTIwbGFuZHNjYXBlfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3ODk5MzM0MDZ8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=80&w=1080','2026-08-31 13:47:39','GVA'),(27,'Aspen','montagna','A premier ski resort town in Colorado, famous for its luxurious chalets and high-end boutiques.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1553406488-baa24daf9b75?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixid=M3wxMDUwMjE5fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8MXx8QXNwZW4lMjBjaXR5JTIwbGFuZHNjYXBlfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3ODk5MzM0MDl8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=80&w=1080','2026-08-31 13:47:42','ASE'),(28,'Banff','montagna','A resort town in the Canadian Rockies known for its mountainous surroundings and hot springs.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1564091455116-1404e7e587f2?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixid=M3wxMDUwMjE5fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8MXx8QmFuZmYlMjBjaXR5JTIwbGFuZHNjYXBlfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3ODk5MzM0MTF8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=80&w=1080','2026-08-31 13:47:44','YYC'),(29,'Queenstown','montagna','The adventure capital of New Zealand, set against the dramatic Southern Alps.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1547314283-befb6cc5cf29?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixid=M3wxMDUwMjE5fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8MXx8UXVlZW5zdG93biUyMGNpdHklMjBsYW5kc2NhcGV8ZW58MHwwfHx8MTc4OTkzMzQxNHww&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=80&w=1080','2026-08-31 13:47:47','ZQN'),(30,'Reykjavik','montagna','The gateway to Iceland\'s dramatic landscape of volcanoes, geysers, and thermal baths.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1606130503037-6a8e